# Creamy splash screen checkpoint

If the user says **creamy splash screen** (or asks to restore/go back to it), restore this exact splash version. Do not redesign. Do not change other screens, navigation, backend, or the iOS Home Screen icon unless they explicitly ask.

## Restore steps

1. Copy `.cursor/checkpoints/creamy-splash-screen/SplashScreen.js` over `mobile/src/screens/SplashScreen.js`.
2. Confirm these bundled assets still exist (copy from `assets/` if missing; do not redraw):
   - Icon: `mobile/assets/telefonak-app-icon-v5.png` (source `assets/Telefonak app icon v5.png`)
   - Wordmark: `mobile/assets/telefonak-word-mark-white-bg-bigger-curved.png` (source `assets/Telefonak word mark white bg bigger curved.png`)
3. Stop. Do not edit layout, sizes, animation, or timing beyond the restore.

## Spec

- Background: solid `#F3F2EF` (not a gradient)
- Layout: LinkedIn-style — v5 app icon visually centered; curved blue wordmark independent at the bottom; safe-area bottom padding
- Icon: `telefonak-app-icon-v5.png` (rounded square, existing size math)
- Wordmark: `telefonak-word-mark-white-bg-bigger-curved.png` (1:1 PNG clipped into existing bottom slot; canvas is `#F3F2EF`)
- Animation: 800ms fade + scale on the icon; wordmark fades with the same opacity
- Timing / App.js boot splash duration: unchanged
